       SUPER+SHIFT+N         Editor              (W-S-n joins the "pham" wifi)
       SUPER+SHIFT+G         Signal              (W-S-g opens the GPT terminal)
       SUPER+SHIFT+E         Email web app       (W-S-e opens a "tk " terminal)
       SUPER+SHIFT+X         X web app           (W-S-x exits labwc)
       SUPER+CTRL+1..9       Bar panels          (hypr/bindings.lua moved these to
